BEHAVIOR htons

DESCRIPTION
  Converts 16-bit value from host to network byte order.
  Network byte order is big-endian.
  Swaps bytes: 0xAABB becomes 0xBBAA.

CONTRACT
  INPUT value int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b15b0b3a

IMPLEMENTATION
  v = LOAD value 8
  # Extract low byte and high byte
  lo = AND v 255 8
  hi = SHR v 8 8
  hi = AND hi 255 8
  # Swap: (lo << 8) | hi
  swapped = SHL lo 8 8
  swapped = OR swapped hi 8
  STORE result swapped 8
END
